+# Preserve Office-free style-probe phase evidence
+
+SOURCE ONLY; syntax, imports, tests, PS, builds and new Windows execution UNRUN. Direct base is combined candidate0f53564afa6a79ff9b7235140afbe85c9cf94bfc. This is bounded test evidence retention, not a timeout fix or native acceptance.
+
+Actual FullCI43163569283 Windows PPTX2/job131000118536 failed at native-furniture-style-controls.mjs:59 with the FIRST PowerShell property probe ETIMEDOUT at the unchanged30000ms limit,06:01:11.3366749Z→06:01:41.5520303Z. The second AST/object harness was unreached. Prior79 job130955319706 passed the whole file (both children) in9.9492489s. All five test/probe/checker/worker/source-scanner files were byte-exact79→0f5. Source has finite AST extraction, one Add-Type compilation, managed reads and optional Windows Scripting.Dictionary creation/Count0→1/release; no unbounded loop or source cause is established. The old timeout remains FAILED and its phase UNKNOWN.
+
+The original test leaves its existing opf-style-* fixture/output paths and both exact child commands unchanged. It now also creates a fresh owned artifacts/native-furniture-style-controls/run-* directory. Before each original child-status assertion, retain the original stdout/stderr, elapsed time, status/signal/error and ONLY the known property report, phase sidecar, harness report and serialized-curved-refusal file when present. No unrelated TEMP directory is scanned/copied. Each known file is capped4MiB and each child stream1MiB; linked/nonregular/changed retained files refuse evidence completeness. Missing known outputs are explicit. Finally attempts preservation again; an original assertion/IO failure is rethrown unchanged if capture also fails. Capture failures cannot convert a failure to PASS and are independently surfaced when the original controls pass.
+
+The property probe writes file-only phase checkpoints beside its existing ReportPath, no new child argument or test scenario. The fixed finite sequence brackets AST, Add-Type, managed reads, Scripting.Dictionary creation, each existing Count0/1 sequence, release and final report. Sequence/UTC/Stopwatch elapsed timestamps are retained; at most32phase records/errors. Logger IO is caught so it cannot replace an existing operation failure; if the original probe otherwise finishes, logger errors refuse successful evidence completion. No new COM calls, Office/process queries, loops, retry, deadline or assertion change is introduced. Recording adds real IO/time overhead and cannot retrospectively explain the original timeout.
+
+The existing nightly Windows PPTX always-upload step adds only this artifact directory. No new job/gate/matrix/permissions or FullCI dispatch is introduced. Previously no picture/quarantine artifact existed and the timeout's temp files/child streams were not uploaded. One later unchanged-limit Windows run can now identify the last durable phase if needed, but no such run is assigned or claimed by this source checkpoint. Production worker/helpers/kernel/observer and every original action/geometry/font/refusal assertion remain unchanged.
